      "content": "hey, i'm starting a new series on my philosophy blog about \"modern morality\" and how it's changing. i want to write a post about what actually matters for people living in a multicultural, digital-age democracy today. \n\ncan you help me out? what do you think are the most important virtues a citizen should have in this kind of world?",
