    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are some pretty heavy concepts. \"radical empathy\" and \"civic courage\" sound like great pillars for a blog post. \n\ncould you expand a bit on why you think these are more important than, say, traditional virtues like individual responsibility or personal autonomy? it feels like a shift in what we value as a society.",
